 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's top five exported product categories by value from 2005 to 2025 are machinery and mechanical appliances, electrical machinery and equipment, iron and steel, plastics and articles thereof, and vehicles and parts.",
  "Total exports amount to 317.53 billion euros, with machinery and mechanical appliances leading at 53.73 billion euros, representing 16.9% of total exports.",
  "Electrical machinery and equipment is the second largest category at 42.27 billion euros, followed by iron and steel at 34.70 billion euros.",
  "The top three export categories together account for 41.2% of total exports, while other products make up 44.1%.",
  "The data are presented in current euros and include a confidential portion of 2.6% that is masked and shown separately, which limits full product detail analysis."
